# Frozen provenance hashes exact working-file bytes (including line endings).
# Disable automatic normalization for source, CSV, JSON, YAML, TeX and binaries.
# -text preserves readable text diffs; it does not mark these files as binary.
* -text

# These two already-tracked, non-frozen files previously used LF blobs and
# CRLF working copies with core.autocrlf=true. Preserve that existing mapping.
/README.md text eol=crlf
/.gitignore text eol=crlf

# Never run add --renormalize on frozen evidence. No global config is required.
